Third-party components bundled in this repository keep their own terms.

The WebAssembly build under pkg/ is generated from SWK, a fork of Blockstream's
Liquid Wallet Kit, which is distributed under a BSD-MIT licence. See the SWK
repository for its text:

    https://github.com/ConcatenaLabs/SWK

The chart library under vendor/vendor/lightweight-charts/ is TradingView
Lightweight Charts, distributed under the Apache License 2.0; its LICENSE and
NOTICE files are beside it. The market view shows its attribution notice.

vendor/word-name.js, copied from the web wallet, holds a list of words taken from the EFF short
wordlist 1 (https://www.eff.org/dice), by the Electronic Frontier Foundation, licensed under the
Creative Commons Attribution 3.0 United States licence
(https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/us/). The list there leaves out every word that is
also in the BIP39 English wordlist and the one entry that is not letters alone.
